@Premium_ServiceAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5169

### Health
GET {{Premium_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/health

### Development token
POST {{Premium_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/dev-auth/token?role=Administrator

### Get premium plans
GET {{Premium_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/premium/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Create premium plan
POST {{Premium_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/premium/plans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "policyTypeId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "frequency": "Monthly",
  "basePremium": 1500.00
}